* Mixed devices: keyboard file naming, then mouse-based file selection.
Goal: Upload a desktop file
. Goal: Open upload dialog
.. Look at <upload button>
.. Point to <upload button>
.. Click <upload button>
. Goal: Find file
.. Recall <file name>
.. Hands to keyboard
.. Type <file name>
.. Keystroke Enter
.. Search for <file name>
. Goal: Select and upload file
.. Hands to mouse
.. Look at <file name>
.. Point to <file name>
.. Click <file name>
.. Look at <open button>
.. Click <open button>
.. Verify upload is complete
